 mathquill-command-id=\"4\" class=\"mq-operator-name\">l</var><var mathquill-command-id=\"5\" class=\"mq-operator-name\">n</var><span class=\"mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"15\"><span class=\"mq-scaled mq-paren\" style=\"transform: scale(1.2, 2.43478);\">(</span><span class=\"mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-block-id=\"13\"><span class=\"mq-fraction mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"8\"><span class=\"mq-numerator\" mathquill-block-id=\"10\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"9\">4</span></span><span class=\"mq-denominator\" mathquill-block-id=\"12\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"11\">3</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0\">​</span></span></span><span class=\"mq-scaled mq-paren\" style=\"transform: scale(1.2, 2.43478);\">)</span></span><span mathquill-command-id=\"17\" class=\"mq-binary-operator\">−</span><span class=\"mq-fraction mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"19\"><span class=\"mq-numerator\" mathquill-block-id=\"21\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"20\">1</span></span><span class=\"mq-denominator\" mathquill-block-id=\"23\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"22\">6</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0\">​</span></span></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>Let's first factor the denominator of the integrand:\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"103\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math dis